1
00:00:01,667 --> 00:00:03,267
[PING] If I were hard on you,

2
00:00:04,033 --> 00:00:06,000
it was only because
I wanted you to learn.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,600
Here.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,233
Give it to our lawyer,

5
00:00:09,233 --> 00:00:11,200
in exchange for what you've
taken from the company.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,533
[SOFT MUSIC PLAYING]

7
00:00:13,533 --> 00:00:15,700
[TOTO] Ping, don't tell me
this is your savings.

8
00:00:16,267 --> 00:00:18,100
You might end up
with nothing left.

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,333
[PING] What matters is we make
right the things you've done.

10
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,167
You don't need to do this, Ping.

11
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:29,533
You know, Toto,
you're my only family left.

12
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:32,433
I don't want you
to get harmed.

13
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,333
Also, I'm here to tell you...

14
00:00:35,333 --> 00:00:37,267
...that I'm bringing you back
to the company.

15
00:00:37,267 --> 00:00:38,233
But...

16
00:00:38,233 --> 00:00:39,533
...there is a condition.

17
00:00:39,533 --> 00:00:40,767
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

18
00:00:40,767 --> 00:00:42,233
I'll do anything, Ping.

19
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:45,333
[EXHALES DEEPLY]
Okay, first of all,

20
00:00:45,667 --> 00:00:47,400
you need to get counseling

21
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,167
so that you don't fall deeper
into gambling.

22
00:00:49,167 --> 00:00:50,733
And I'm going to give you
a different role

23
00:00:50,733 --> 00:00:53,033
where you won't have
to handle money.

24
00:00:53,033 --> 00:00:54,633
I'm also going to cut
your monthly salary

25
00:00:54,633 --> 00:00:56,500
so that you can pay off
the ten million.

26
00:00:57,233 --> 00:00:59,667
[BREATHING DEEPLY]

27
00:01:01,233 --> 00:01:02,467
Thank you, Ping.

28
00:01:03,567 --> 00:01:05,500
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

29
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:06,500
[TAPPING GENTLY]

30
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,233
You're welcome.

31
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:12,367
We'll get through this.

32
00:01:12,367 --> 00:01:14,400
Just promise that
you'll help yourself, okay?

33
00:01:15,367 --> 00:01:17,200
Have some snacks first.

34
00:01:17,467 --> 00:01:18,767
You're probably hungry.

35
00:01:19,333 --> 00:01:20,333
Thank you.

36
00:01:20,333 --> 00:01:27,333
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

37
00:01:29,633 --> 00:01:31,600
[TOTO] Ping, I'll be
your best man, okay?

38
00:01:31,833 --> 00:01:33,333
[SCOFFS LIGHTLY]
You're silly.

39
00:01:33,667 --> 00:01:35,833
Donato wanted us to get married

40
00:01:35,833 --> 00:01:37,767
so that someone could watch
his business.

41
00:01:37,767 --> 00:01:39,267
[TOTO]
So It's just a business deal?

42
00:01:40,067 --> 00:01:41,333
[PING] It started that way.

43
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:44,200
But I hope...

44
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:47,467
[SOFT MUSIC CONTINUES]

45
00:01:47,467 --> 00:01:49,300
I hope it becomes real
for her.

46
00:01:50,167 --> 00:01:51,767
Because it's already real
for me.

47
00:01:51,767 --> 00:01:57,467
[TENDER MUSIC PLAYING]

48
00:01:57,467 --> 00:02:01,167
[TOTO] Ping, I know that I've
broken your trust many times.

49
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:03,433
So, my brother,
I hope this time...

50
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:06,233
...you trust what
your heart tells you.

51
00:02:06,567 --> 00:02:07,767
Fight for it.

52
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:11,800
[TOTO]
<i> I've ruined my brother's name.</i>

53
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,467
<i> I've done my part.</i>

54
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:15,433
<i>Now, pay off off my debt
to the company</i>

55
00:02:15,433 --> 00:02:18,500
<i>and make sure
I don't end up in prison.</i>

56
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:22,667
[UNSETTLING MUSIC PLAYING]

57
00:02:22,667 --> 00:02:23,767
[TOTO] Listen, Ping...

58
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,200
Keep your eyes open, okay?

59
00:02:27,133 --> 00:02:31,300
There are snakes out there,
ready to strike.

60
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,567
Who?

61
00:02:37,467 --> 00:02:40,367
[UNSETTLING MUSIC CONTINUES]
